d and by the way I made a whole  video in which I used some real-world  examples to explain why Kalin Khalifa  were able to increase their  powers sold quickly so if that's  something you're interested in I will  leave a link in the description also if  you enjoy the Dragon Ball super content  on this channel be sure to leave a like  to let me know and if you're new don't  forget to subscribe and hit that  notification belly yes I really like hit  starting next Saturday we are planning  to watch the new episodes of Dragon Ball  super as they come out live on our  twitch channel we don't do reactions  here on YouTube but we will be hanging  out on Twitch and chatting if you want  to share the epicness alive we will have  a timer on so you can follow the episode  along with us and if you want to hang  out and chat with us live  follow us on twitch twitch TV slash  anime uproar link will also be in the  description whether you loved or hated  them over the course of the series we  have gotten used to the characters from  universe 6 and it really does seem harsh  for them to have all been erased  out of existence like this so this leads  us to the big question is universe 6  gone forever  or will our heroes from universe 7 find  a way to bring them back Vegeta told  cabba  that a few number 6 lost in the  tournament that he would wish them back  into existence using the super Dragon  Balls although we have never seen Super  Shenron actually bring back an entire  universe so we don't technically know if  it's even possible since his power is  described as unlimited as long as there  is only one wish we can assume that  wishing universe 6 back with the super  Dragon Balls is a real possibility  in fact in Dragon Ball Z the Dragon  Balls were used to bring back everyone  who was killed by Frieza and his forces  on Namek and also everyone who was  killed by cell and the androids on earth  so if super Shenron can revive entire  universes it may be possible for Goku or  Veget